  "body_html": "<h1>decisive_minimal</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem decisive_minimal [Fintype N] [Nonempty N] [Fintype A] (h0 : ∃ x y z : A, x ≠ y ∧ x ≠ z ∧ y ≠ z) {F : SWF N A} (hU : SWF.Unanimity F) (hIIA : SWF.IIA F) : Minimal (exists_nonempty_decisive_of_size F) 1</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SWF</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>IIA</li>\n<li>exists_nonempty_decisive_of_size</li>\n<li>exists_minimal_decisive_coalition</li>\n<li>decisive_contraction</li>\n</ul>",
